# Ablation (c): the measured stack. Diffbot's per-expert host plan, split launch with side-stream SM budget, xmoe
# kernels and THOR_* VRAM trims, with the values of the recipe's serve.sh. Factors (override from the environment):
#   PLAN          path of a host-expert plan JSON ("none" = empty plan, every expert in VRAM)
#   OVERLAP_SMS   decode SM budget for host experts (recipe 32); OVERLAP_SMS_PREFILL (recipe 64)
#   SPEC          dspark | none ; SPEC_K (recipe 5)
#   ENGRAM_INT4   1 (int4 tables, recipe) | 0 (FP8 tables, needs a pack with FP8 Engram shards)
MODEL=exl3
QUANT=exl3
PLUGINS=vllm_exl3
ENGRAM_INT4=${ENGRAM_INT4:-1}
PLAN=${PLAN:-/opt/recipe/plans/plan-gen30-dh.json}
OVERLAP_SMS=${OVERLAP_SMS:-32}
OVERLAP_SMS_PREFILL=${OVERLAP_SMS_PREFILL:-64}
EXTRA_ARGS=
DIFFBOT_HOOKS=1
